@SwiftBank_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Verify the API and Swagger document are running
GET {{SwiftBank_Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Log in with the seeded development user
# @name login
POST {{SwiftBank_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Get the authenticated user's dashboard
GET {{SwiftBank_Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get the authenticated user's accounts
GET {{SwiftBank_Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
